createMonomialSubalgebra -- creates a monomial subalgebra
*********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        createMonomialSubalgebra L
  * Inputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, list of monomials that are the
        generators of the subalgebra
  * Outputs:
      * a *note monomial subalgebra: MonomialSubalgebra,,  the subalgebra of
        the polynomial ring of the monomials that has the given monomials as
        generators

Description
===========


+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R=ZZ/37[x,y,z];                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : S=createMonomialSubalgebra {x^2*y, x*z, z^3}    |
|                                                     |
|o2 = MonomialSubalgebra{cache => CacheTable{}       }|
|                                        2         3  |
|                        generators => {x y, x*z, z } |
|                        ring => R                    |
|                                                     |
|o2 : MonomialSubalgebra of R                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------+

