intclMonIdeal -- normalization of Rees algebra
**********************************************

Description
===========

This function computes the integral closure of a monomial ideal
I=(f_1,\ldots,f_m)\subset R in the polynomial ring R[t] and the normalization
of its Rees algebra. The normalization of the Rees algebra is the integral
closure of R[f_1t,\ldots,f_mt] in R[t]. For a definition of the Rees algebra
(or Rees ring) see Bruns and Herzog, Cohen-Macaulay rings, Cambridge University
Press 1998, p. 182.

