intersectionValRings -- intersection of ring of valuations
**********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        intersectionValRings(v,r)
  * Inputs:
      * a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, rows are the values of the
        indeterminates
      * a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,,  the basering
