MonomialSubalgebra -- class of monomial subalgebras
***************************************************

Description
===========


A monomial subalgebra is a subalgebra of a polynomial ring generated by
monomials. In other words, it is a monoid algebra. A new monomial subalgebra
can be created using *note createMonomialSubalgebra: createMonomialSubalgebra,.
